# Local AI-assistant context for DeepSeek Harness (not source)
.dsh/

# dsh-snapshot is a plain Node package that happens to live in this tree. The
# Java-oriented rules above (`lib/`, `libs/`, `*.toml`) would otherwise hide its
# source from git — `lib/index.js` is the entire engine, so losing it to an
# ignore rule would be silent and total. Re-include the package wholesale; the
# later rules win over the earlier ones.
!dsh-snapshot/
!dsh-snapshot/**
